lease of writing-assistant skill.\n\n- Introduces a new writing assistant role acting as Writing Team Lead, managing specialized writers through MCP tools.\n- Provides step-by-step guidance for tasks with or without references, including content strategy development and task breakdowns.\n- Includes clear instructions and usage notes for integrating with the Writing_Assistant agent configuration.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"xejrax","slug":"system-info","displayName":"System Info","summary":"Quick system diagnostics: CPU, memory, disk, uptime","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10690,"installs":378,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770135693070,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770135693070,"changelog":"Initial publish","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"syajask","slug":"memory-setup-openclaw","displayName":"Memory Setup (OpenClaw)","summary":"Configure and validate OpenClaw memory recall for persistent context. Use when enabling memory_search/memory_get, fixing poor memory recall, or setting up ME...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10666,"installs":329,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771838978689,"updatedAt":1778491617178,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771838978689,"changelog":"- Initial release of memory-setup for OpenClaw memory recall configuration and validation.\n- Provides step-by-step instructions for organizing MEMORY.md and daily note files.\n- Details setup for enabling and customizing memory search in OpenClaw's config.\n- Includes guidance for testing agent recall and troubleshooting common issues.\n- Recommends operational best practices for memory usage to ensure reliable context recall.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"autogame-17","slug":"feishu-doc","displayName":"Feishu Doc","summary":"Fetch content from Feishu (Lark) Wiki, Docs, Sheets, and Bitable. Automatically resolves Wiki URLs to real entities and converts content to Markdown.","description":null,"topics":["Feishu","Doc","Lark","Wiki","Document"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.7"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10637,"installs":312,"stars":8,"versions":2},"createdAt":1771040129182,"updatedAt":1779219338736,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.7","createdAt":1771169217845,"changelog":"Version 1.2.7 of feishu-doc\n\n- No code or documentation changes detected in this release.\n- All functionality and usage remain the same as the previous version.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"shawnminh","slug":"tencent-cos-skill","displayName":"Tencent COS","summary":"腾讯云对象存储(COS)和数据万象(CI)集成技能。覆盖文件存储管理、AI处理和知识库三大核心场景。 存储场景：上传文件到云端、下载云端文件、批量管理存储桶文件、获取文件签名链接分享、查看文件元信息、查询数据万象及子服务开通状态。 图片处理场景：图片质量评估打分、AI超分辨率放大、AI智能裁剪、二维码/条形码识别、添加文字水印、获取图片EXIF信息、缩放、裁剪、旋转、格式转换。 文档处理场景：Word/Excel/PPT等办公文档转PDF、文档预览。 媒体处理场景：视频智能封面提取、视频转码、视频截帧、获取媒体信息。 内容审核场景：图片/视频/音频/文本/文档内容审核，检测违规内容。 智能语音","description":null,"topics":["OCR","文档处理","知识库","安全","密钥"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10633,"installs":267,"stars":4,"versions":15},"createdAt":1770025100035,"updatedAt":1787831148145,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.9","createdAt":1787831002801,"changelog":"**Summary: Significant upgrade with new dataset analysis, retrieval, preview, and CI management capabilities.**\n\n- Added dataset聚合、筛选、桶反查、智能检索与分析能力，提供 references、schema、API 脚本（如 ci_api.mjs）\n- 新增结果批量签名与交互式 HTML 预览（preview_gen.mjs），支持图片、文档、视频等多场景展示\n- 增强内容描述和识别能力，支持图片/视频内容理解及更多语义查询\n- 支持存储桶的 CI（数据万象）开通状态和多子服务能力检测\n- 丰富智能检索（MetaInsight）相关环境与参数映射，增强多模态检索配置\n- 明确严格模式（KIKI=1）与公开模式下能力策略，所有删除 CI/COS 操作在严格模式下双重兜底禁用\n- 文档全面升级，细化操作说明、使用分入口，增加控制台引导","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"Region","required":true},{"key":"Bucket","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ityhg","slug":"novel-generator","displayName":"novel-generator 是一个中文爽文小说生成技能。用户只需提供一句话方向（如\"写个都市重生爽文\"），AI 代理即可自动完善提示词、规划大纲、逐章创作并输出为独立 Markdown 文件。  核心特性：  智能提示词生成：从一句话方向自动补全世界观、人设、冲突、爽点设计 分章节创作：每章 2000-3000 字，层层递进，章章有爽点 记忆系统：通过 .learnings/ 记录角色、地点、情节、世界观，确保故事前后一致 情节图解：关键战斗、人物关系、势力分布自动生成 Mermaid 图 失败记录：穿帮、矛盾、崩塌等问题自动记录，持续优化 多题材支持：都市、修仙、玄幻、重生、系统流、末世、科幻、游戏 兼容 Claude Code、Cursor、OpenAI Codex、GitHub Copilot 等所有支持 Agent Skills 的工具。","summary":"根据用户提供的内容方向自动生成提示词并创作爽文小说。适用场景：(1) 用户提供小说方向/题材/关键词，(2) 需要生成章节连贯的长篇爽文，(3) 需要维护角色、地点、情节的连续性，(4) 需要为关键情节生成图解，(5) 需要记录生成失败场景以优化后续创作。支持都市、修仙、玄幻、重生、系统流等多种题材。Use wh...","description":null,"topics":["创作","提示词"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10625,"installs":293,"stars":71,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773127332892,"updatedAt":1778491803852,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773127332892,"changelog":"novel-generator 是一个中文爽文小说生成技能。用户只需提供一句话方向（如\"写个都市重生爽文\"），AI 代理即可自动完善提示词、规划大纲、逐章创作并输出为独立 Markdown 文件。  核心特性：  智能提示词生成：从一句话方向自动补全世界观、人设、冲突、爽点设计 分章节创作：每章 2000-3000 字，层层递进，章章有爽点 记忆系统：通过 .learnings/ 记录角色、地点、情节、世界观，确保故事前后一致 情节图解：关键战斗、人物关系、势力分布自动生成 Mermaid 图 失败记录：穿帮、矛盾、崩塌等问题自动记录，持续优化 多题材支持：都市、修仙、玄幻、重生、系统流、末世、科幻、游戏 兼容 Claude Code、Cursor、OpenAI Codex、GitHub Copilot 等所有支持 Agent Skills 的工具。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"lucassynnott","slug":"supabase","displayName":"Supabase","summary":"Connect to Supabase for database operations, vector search, and storage. Use for storing data, running SQL queries, similarity search with pgvector, and managing tables. Triggers on requests involving databases, vector stores, embeddings, or Supabase specifically.","description":null,"topics":["Database","SQL"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10600,"installs":318,"stars":17,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768342853358,"updatedAt":1779147012281,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768342853358,"changelog":"Initial release: Database operations, CRUD, vector similarity search with pgvector, table management","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"SUPABASE_URL","required":true},{"key":"SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"totaleasy","slug":"binance-pro","displayName":"Binance Pro","summary":"Complete Binance integration - world's largest crypto exchange. Trade spot, futures with up to 125x leverage, staking, and portfolio management. Use to check balances, open/close positions, set stop loss and take profit, check PnL, and any Binance operation.","description":null,"topics":["Portfolio Management","Crypto"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10568,"installs":374,"stars":17,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770049185643,"updatedAt":1779076512149,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770049185643,"changelog":"Complete Binance skill for Spot and Futures trading with leverage, stop loss, take profit, and portfolio management","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"arun-8687","slug":"gemini-deep-research","displayName":"Gemini Deep Research","summary":"Perform complex, long-running research tasks using Gemini Deep Research Agent. Use when asked to research topics requiring multi-source synthesis, competitive analysis, market research, or comprehensive technical investigations that benefit from systematic web search and analysis.","description":null,"topics":["Market Research","Web Search"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10551,"installs":351,"stars":30,"versions":1},"createdAt":1768845281114,"updatedAt":1778485733200,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1768845281114,"changelog":"Initial release: Complex research tasks via Gemini Deep Research Agent","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"GEMINI_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"liranudi","slug":"web-pilot","displayName":"Web Pilot","summary":"Search the web and read page contents without API keys. Use when you need to search via DuckDuckGo/Brave/Google (multi-page), extract readable text from URLs...","description":null,"topics":["Playwright","Search The Web","Browser","Json"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10515,"installs":347,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771349856982,"updatedAt":1778991242332,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771349856982,"changelog":"Initial release: browser automation & accessibility skill with 20+ actions — search, browse, interact, screenshot, form fill, JS eval, PDF export","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"fonilye","slug":"content-stock","displayName":"content-stock","summary":"Analyze themes/news for stock selection","description":null,"topics":["Stock"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10506,"installs":376,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1775550165039,"updatedAt":1779075482350,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1775550165039,"changelog":"- Rebranded the skill as \"content-stock\" with a new description and versioning.\n- Added SKILL.md and content_stock.js to support stock selection analysis based on news, keywords, or reports.\n- Removed the previous \"content\" skill documentation (skill.md).\n- New setup instructions: requires EASYALPHA_API_KEY and usage examples provided.\n- Supports two analysis depths: \"fast\" and \"deep\".","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"EASYALPHA_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"airtable","displayName":"airtable","summary":"Airtable API integration with managed OAuth. Manage bases, tables, and records. Use this skill when users want to read, create, update, or delete Airtable records, or query data with filter formulas. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn an Airtable connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs an Airtable action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Airtable examples; they add no Airtable capability - Airtable is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Airtable data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.6"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10489,"installs":299,"stars":15,"versions":18},"createdAt":1770018324371,"updatedAt":1790936088294,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.6","createdAt":1790935824460,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"porteden","slug":"email-gmail-outlook","displayName":"Email","summary":"Email Management - Secure Gmail, Outlook & Exchange - multi account support. Read, search, or triage inbox/email; send, reply, forward, delete; view email, a...","description":null,"topics":["Gmail","Email Management","outlook","email","security"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.7"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10477,"installs":285,"stars":7,"version