"latest":"1.0.0","ui":"1.0.0","ux":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10041,"installs":292,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773108531923,"updatedAt":1778491799807,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1773108531923,"changelog":"Initial release: 前端设计质量提升，anti-patterns + 设计命令，参考 impeccable 项目","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"gongyu0918-debug","slug":"chinese-official-writing","displayName":"中文公文写作","summary":"用于中文公文、事务性材料和新闻稿件的起草、改写、压缩、润色、审校、文种核对、去口语化、降 AI 味及 Word 格式处理，适用于机关、企事业单位、学校和新闻机构。涵盖申请、请示、报告、通知、通告、意见、决定、决议、议案、公报、命令、函、复函、批复、说明、方案、纪要、公告、公示、通报、制度、规定、办法、细则、操作规程、工作要点、总结、调研、讲话、致辞、主持词、述职、可研、审查材料、技术需求、新闻消息、编者按、新闻评论，以及采购、整改、反馈和 AI 算力等场景。","description":null,"topics":["chinese-writing","official-writing","office-productivity","content-creation"],"tags":{"\"chinese":"1.4.15","ai-compute":"1.6.25","ai-compute\"":"1.4.15","chinese":"1.6.25","chinese official-document writing gongwen ai-compute":"1.5.38","gongwen":"1.6.25","latest":"2.0.39","official-document":"1.6.25","writing":"1.6.25"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10030,"installs":70,"stars":1,"versions":153},"createdAt":1778229986946,"updatedAt":1792391920552,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.0.39","createdAt":1792391607606,"changelog":"2.0.39\n\n说明材料按实际用途展开事实、过程和关系，原因、影响与当前状态按解释需要选用，减少机械套用完整骨架。\n\n校准快速写稿边界：材料明确的多接收方、备选渠道和分步要求，可在满足快速条件时直接转述；需要推导或设计职责程序的任务继续走完整路径。\n\n审核入口按本轮材料、最新版待审稿和用户限定范围核对，由审核页确定补读与交付，减少起草流程对限定审核的干扰。\n\n本版整合已完成真实材料对照的最小修订；重复读取、制作说明与个别误审仍有波动，不承诺固定提速或全场景稳定。","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"cellcog","slug":"video-generation-cellcog","displayName":"Video Generation","summary":"AI video generation and production powered by CellCog. Marketing videos, product demos, explainers, educational content, lipsync spokesperson videos, UGC, news reports, training materials, cinematic short films, social media reels, YouTube content. Up to 4-minute videos — scripted, voiced, scored, and edited from a single prompt.","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Video Generation","News","Prompt"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.18"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10030,"installs":302,"stars":25,"versions":19},"createdAt":1770176494040,"updatedAt":1787536938613,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.18","createdAt":1787536894014,"changelog":"Content updated.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"CELLCOG_API_KEY","required":true}],"os":["darwin","linux","windows"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mvanhorn","slug":"polymarket","displayName":"Polymarket","summary":"Query and trade on Polymarket prediction markets — check odds, trending markets, search events, view order books, place trades, and manage positions. Now ava...","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":10002,"installs":306,"stars":24,"versions":6},"createdAt":1769068161418,"updatedAt":1778986981814,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.1","createdAt":1772859029726,"changelog":"Fix display name (remove Clawdbot prefix)","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"devops","displayName":"DevOps","summary":"Runs the delivery side of software: CI/CD pipelines, release and rollback strategy, environments, reliability and on-call. Use when designing or fixing a pipeline, when builds are slow, flaky, or green locally and red in CI; when planning a deploy — rolling, blue-green, canary, feature flags — or rolling a release back; when promoting an artifact to production, standing up preview environments, or chasing drift; when a schema change, backfill, or DNS cutover must ship without downtime; when pipeline secrets, OIDC, or deploy permissions need hardening; when alerts are noisy, an SLO or error budget is missing, or burn-rate paging is wrong; for on-call, severities, postmortems, runbooks, and DORA metrics; when infrastructure drifts from code, or backups were never restored. Not for Kubernetes manifests (`k8s`), image builds (`docker`), H