gin\", \"connect WeChat...","description":null,"topics":["WeChat"],"tags":{"latest":"2.1.0","wechat":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":5,"downloads":9869,"installs":268,"stars":20,"versions":5},"createdAt":1770094918954,"updatedAt":1778987998708,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.1.0","createdAt":1774613333457,"changelog":"Wechat Connect 2.1.0 introduces automated plugin installation for a smoother user experience.\n\n- The skill now automatically installs the @tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin plugin if it is not already present; manual terminal steps are no longer required.\n- Updated documentation to reflect the new auto-installation process and adjusted dependency installation notes.\n- No code changes detected in this release.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"palmpalm7","slug":"xiaohongshu-deep-research","displayName":"Xiaohongshu Deep Research","summary":"Deep research on Xiaohongshu (小红书) topics. Use when user wants to research a topic, analyze trends, gather insights from top posts, or produce a summary repo...","description":null,"topics":["小红书"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":9865,"installs":331,"stars":11,"versions":4},"createdAt":1772319267475,"updatedAt":1778994071524,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.1","createdAt":1772321057182,"changelog":"文件夹命名改为 YYYYMMDD_HHmm 格式","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jhc888007","slug":"multi-search-engine-simple","displayName":"Multi Search Engine 极简国内版","summary":"【国内精简版】多种免费搜索方式在互联网上搜索最新信息，10个国内网站（精简7个国内不能访问的海外网站）","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9846,"installs":301,"stars":12,"versions":1},"createdAt":1774870222345,"updatedAt":1778492299065,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1774870222345,"changelog":"**Version 1.0.0 - Major update: Transition to a China-focused, simplified search engine tool**\n\n- Reduced integrated search engines from 17 to 10, keeping only accessible and practical options for users in China.\n- Removed support, references, and guides for 7 overseas/global search sites that are not accessible domestically.\n- Deleted outdated documentation files and previous changelogs.\n- Updated project description and documentation to reflect focus on 10 domestic and accessible search platforms.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"binggg","slug":"cloudbase","displayName":"腾讯云 CloudBase · Tencent CloudBase","summary":"Use this skill when you develop, design, build, deploy, debug, migrate, or troubleshoot CloudBase (腾讯云开发, 云开发, TCB, 微信云开发) projects — Web, 微信小程序, 小程序, uni-app, mobile (iOS, Android, Flutter, React Native). Covers UI (页面, 界面, 表单, dashboard, prototype, 原型); auth (登录, 注册, OAuth, publishable key); databases (NoSQL 文档数据库, MySQL 关系型数据库, PostgreSQL/CloudBase PG, app.rdb(), queryPgDatabase/managePgDatabase, CRUD, security rules); 云函数/cloud functions (serverless, scf_bootstrap); CloudRun (云托管, Dockerfile); 云存储; built-in AI (内置大模型, AI 对话, streaming, 流式输出, 图片生成, generateText, streamText, createModel, generateImage, TokenHub, Hunyuan, DeepSeek, GLM, Kimi, Token Credits 资源包, 小程序成长计划); third-party/custom model onboarding (第三方大模型接入, 大模型调用, LLM API); AI agent (智能体, AG-UI, LangGraph); ops troubleshooting (巡检, 诊断, 日志); spec workflow (需求文档, 技术方案, requirements, tasks.md). Do NOT use for non-CloudBase projects, pure frontend without CloudBase, or self-hosted backends without CloudBase.","description":null,"topics":["cloudbase","腾讯云开发","serverless","baas","后端一体化"],"tags":{"latest":"1.92.145"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9822,"installs":125,"stars":0,"versions":238},"createdAt":1773297675866,"updatedAt":1792379311953,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.92.145","createdAt":1792378673554,"changelog":"Recent commits / 最近提交: | - feat(mcp)!: MCP Apps 面板改为实验性、默认关闭；bump 2.36.0 (#1208) | - chore(experts): auto-bump versions for changed packs [skip ci] | - polish(mcp-ui): 按交互审视意见改掉五处 (#1207) | - chore(experts): auto-bump versions for changed packs [skip ci] | - feat(mcp): CLOUDBASE_MCP_UI=off 可以把面板整体关掉 (#1206)","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"chenleiyanquan","slug":"receiving-code-review","displayName":"Receiving Code Review","summary":"Use when receiving code review feedback, before implementing suggestions, especially if feedback seems unclear or technically questionable - requires technical rigor and verification, not performative agreement or blind implementation","description":null,"topics":["Code Review"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9817,"installs":212,"stars":3,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769580721451,"updatedAt":1778987270911,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769580721451,"changelog":"- Initial release of the skill for rigorous code review reception.\n- Outlines a step-by-step pattern for handling code review feedback, focusing on technical verification before implementation.\n- Specifies forbidden performative or uncritical responses; promotes technical acknowledgment or pushback.\n- Includes guidance for unclear feedback, source-specific review handling, and the YAGNI principle.\n- Provides practical examples, common mistakes, and correct formats for updates and replies.\n- Sets clear rules for interactions in collaborative tools like GitHub.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"google-docs","displayName":"google-docs","summary":"Google Docs API integration with managed OAuth. Create documents, insert text, apply formatting, and manage content. Use this skill when users want to interact with Google Docs. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every call is authenticated as the user's connection and reaches only what that connection's authorization allows, which the provider enforces on every request; the endpoints documented here are the ones this skill uses, and any other endpoint of this app needs the user to ask for it by name. Default to read and list calls, and confirm every write or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Google Docs connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Google Docs action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Google Docs examples; they add no Google Docs capability - Google Docs is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Google Docs data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Docs","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9777,"installs":283,"stars":8,"versions":16},"createdAt":1770022129235,"updatedAt":1790937808474,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.5","createdAt":1790937659963,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"reflection","displayName":"Self Reflection","summary":"Learns when to stop and review. Self-critiques before showing you, fewer revision rounds.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9774,"installs":288,"stars":7,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770840591380,"updatedAt":1778487906275,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1772063524684,"changelog":"Major rewrite. Visual workflow, pattern detection system, proactive lesson injection, and multi-trigger architecture.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"edwininau","slug":"explain-code","displayName":"explain-code","summary":"用可视化图表和类比解释代码。在解释代码如何工作、教授代码库或用户询问如何工作时使用","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9772,"installs":327,"stars":5,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772011041554,"updatedAt":1778491636632,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772011041554,"changelog":"- 初始版本发布，根据SKILL.md描述设计解释方式  \n- 采用类比和日常生活比喻帮助理解代码  \n- 使用ASCII画图展示流程和结构  \n- 步进式逐行讲解代码执行过程  \n- 强调并指出常见误解或易错点  \n- 支持多重类比，帮助解释复杂概念","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"zways","slug":"automate-excel","displayName":"Automate Excel","summary":"Automates reading, writing, merging, transforming, and validating Excel (.xlsx/.xls) files. Use when the user works with spreadsheets, .xlsx files, Excel dat...","description":null,"topics":["CSV","Spreadsheets"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9770,"installs":305,"stars":4,"versions":4},"createdAt":1772772104620,"updatedAt":1778491745273,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.3","createdAt":1772774736664,"changelog":"Initial public release with a comprehensive toolkit of Excel and CSV batch automation scripts.\n\n- Added 18+ command line scripts for Excel/CSV tasks: merging, conversion, deduplication, filtering, aggregation, validation, splitting, VLOOKUP, renaming sheets, formatting, and template fill.\n- Provided ready-to-use code samples and detailed usage guides in SKILL.md.\n- Included requirements.txt for easy dependency installation.\n- All scripts operate independently and support command line arguments for flexible batch processing.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"0731coderlee-sudo","slug":"wechat-publisher","displayName":"Wechat Publisher","summary":"一键发布 Markdown 到微信公众号草稿箱。基于 wenyan-cli，支持多主题、代码高亮、图片自动上传。","description":null,"topics":["WeChat","