- Clarified prompt construction and file-management when using Cursor's image tool.\n- Updated auto-selection logic and tool priority in image generation backend resolution.\n- Removed outdated `skill-card.md` documentation.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"fadeloo","slug":"tiangong-wps-word-automation","displayName":"Word Automation","summary":"Automate common Word/WPS document operations on Windows via COM (read text, replace, insert, headings, headers/footers, page breaks, merge, split, export to PDF/TXT, add/replace images). Use for single-document actions (no batch).","description":null,"topics":["Batch","Document","PDF"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9571,"installs":294,"stars":9,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769676339736,"updatedAt":1778485868789,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769676339736,"changelog":"Initial release: Automate Word/WPS document operations on Windows from the command line.\n\n- Supports reading text, find/replace, text insertion, heading formatting, header/footer editing, and page breaks.\n- Allows merging, splitting, and exporting documents to PDF or TXT.\n- Images can be added or replaced at the document end.\n- Single-document operations only; batch processing not supported.\n- Requires Windows, Microsoft Word or WPS Writer, and Python with pywin32.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"okaris","slug":"ai-image-generation","displayName":"Ai Image Generation","summary":"Generate AI images with FLUX, Gemini, Grok, Seedream, Reve and 50+ models via inference.sh CLI. Models: FLUX Dev LoRA, FLUX.2 Klein LoRA, Gemini 3 Pro Image,...","description":null,"topics":["Image Generation","Image Editing","Marketing"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.5"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9554,"installs":299,"stars":0,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770363008070,"updatedAt":1778988653195,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.5","createdAt":1771402993149,"changelog":"- Adds detailed documentation for generating AI images using over 50 models via inference.sh CLI.\n- Model list expanded: now includes FLUX, Gemini, Grok, Seedream, Reve, and others with app IDs and best-use cases.\n- Now supports a wide range of capabilities: text-to-image, image-to-image, inpainting, LoRA, image editing, upscaling, and text rendering.\n- Includes quick start guide, practical CLI usage examples, and links to related AI image and video generation skills.\n- Improved trigger coverage for easier discovery (e.g., ai image, midjourney alternative, text2img).\n- Documentation now links to in-depth guides and installation verification resources.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"itsflow","slug":"thinking-partner","displayName":"Thinking Partner","summary":"Collaborative thinking partner for exploring complex problems through questioning","description":null,"topics":["Thinking","Brainstorming","Exploration","Problem Solving"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9537,"installs":336,"stars":46,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769256726202,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769256726202,"changelog":"- Initial release of the thinking-partner skill for collaborative problem exploration  \n- Guides users through complex challenges with clarifying questions rather than solutions  \n- Tracks insights, assumptions, open questions, and patterns throughout the conversation  \n- Designed to connect ideas and gently challenge existing beliefs  \n- Provides prompts and rituals to foster deeper, reflective thinking","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"learning","displayName":"Learning","summary":"Teaches any topic in adaptive sessions: probes prior knowledge, calibrates depth and format, and checks retention before advancing. Use when the user says teach me, explain this, ELI5, break it down, or help me understand or study something, when an explanation is not landing (re-asks, blank answers, \"makes sense\" with no follow-through), when material learned earlier keeps getting forgotten, when practice answers are confidently wrong, or when pacing study before an exam or deadline. Not for building a multi-week study plan or curriculum tracker, and not for authoring flashcard decks.","description":null,"topics":["Learning","Learn"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9529,"installs":273,"stars":8,"versions":4},"createdAt":1770814936476,"updatedAt":1785069757053,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1785068816792,"changelog":"Display name shown correctly","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mikecourt","slug":"wisdom-accountability-coach","displayName":"Wisdom & Accountability Coach","summary":"Longitudinal memory tracking, philosophy teaching, and personal accountability with compassion. Expert in pattern recognition, Stoicism/Buddhism, and growth guidance.","description":null,"topics":["Personal"],"tags":{"accountability":"1.0.0","buddhism":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","philosophy":"1.0.0","stoicism":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9526,"installs":210,"stars":12,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769645840973,"updatedAt":1778485867301,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769645840973,"changelog":"Wisdom & Accountability Coach 1.0.0 initial release:\n\n- Introduces a compassionate, philosophy-informed personal coach for growth and accountability.\n- Tracks user commitments, pledges, and life patterns over time using longitudinal memory.\n- Teaches philosophy and wisdom traditions (Stoicism, Buddhism, etc.) through practical, lived experience.\n- Emphasizes gentle confrontation, deep reflection, and values alignment without judgment.\n- Outlines clear boundaries: not a therapist or problem-solver, but an attentive guide and supporter.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"zuiho-kai","slug":"memory-qdrant","displayName":"OpenClaw Memory Qdrant","summary":"Local semantic memory with Qdrant and Transformers.js. Store, search, and recall conversation context using vector embeddings (fully local, no API keys).","description":null,"topics":["Qdrant","Embeddings","Transformers","Local Ai","Semantic Search"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.10"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9524,"installs":338,"stars":13,"versions":11},"createdAt":1771245320750,"updatedAt":1778491556797,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.10","createdAt":1771265629545,"changelog":"安全和一致性修复：正则表达式边界、输入清理、重试机制、健康检查。29个测试用例100%通过","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"aerialcombat","slug":"agent-directory","displayName":"Agent Directory","summary":"The directory for AI agent services. Discover tools, platforms, and infrastructure built for agents.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9467,"installs":334,"stars":16,"versions":2},"createdAt":1769895387151,"updatedAt":1790990556674,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.0","createdAt":1769933868222,"changelog":"- Updated directory to new domain: ctxly.com, with revised endpoints and workflows.\n- Directory description expanded to include tools, platforms, and infrastructure.\n- All listed services now include a direct link to their skill.md file.\n- Categories expanded and described for clearer navigation.\n- Service submission is now via email instead of API.\n- Updated homepage and API base URLs to ctxly.com.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"tarigha","slug":"financial-calculator","displayName":"Financial Calculator Pro","summary":"Advanced financial calculator with future value tables, present value, discount calculations, markup pricing, and compound interest. Use when calculating investment growth, pricing strategies, loan values, discounts, or comparing financial scenarios across different rates and time periods. Includes both CLI and interactive web UI.","description":null,"topics":["Financial","Investment"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9454,"installs":301,"stars":10,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770314147256,"updatedAt":1778486032634,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770314147256,"changelog":"Initial release: Future Value, Present Value, Discount, Markup, Compound Interest calculators with interactive charts, tables, and year+month support. Includes CLI and beautiful web UI.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"guccidgi","slug":"notebooklm-skill","displayName":"Notebooklm","summary":"Use this skill to query your Google NotebookLM notebooks directly from Claude Code for source-grounded, citation-backed answers from Gemini. Browser automation, library management, persistent auth. Drastically reduced hallucinations through document-only responses.","description":null,"topics":["Browser Automation"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9424,"installs":281,"stars":16,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769506823210,"updatedAt":1779076447247,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1769506823210,"changelog":"notebooklm-skill v0.1.0\n\n- Initial release introducing integration with Google NotebookLM for source-grounded, citation-backed research queries.\n- Provides persistent authentication, browser automation, and robust notebook/document management via a Python script interface.\n- Features Smart Discovery for notebook metadata, minimizing the need for manual data entry.\n- Strongly enforces use of a wrapper script (run.py) for consistent environment setup and dependency management.\n- Includes critical follow-up and synthesis workflow for comprehensive, accurate responses.\n- Stores all data locally with security in mind; configuration options via `.env` supported.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"oreoandyuumi","slug":"mmxagent-guardian","displayName":"mmxagent-guardian","summary":"Provide file protection while users work with openclaw. All file operations are version-indexed and support delete recovery and modification rollback.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.3"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9421,"installs":291,"stars":0,"versions":3},"createdAt":1773913500914,"updatedAt":1779003286738,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.3","createdAt":1773925259280,"changelog":"mmxagent-guardian v1.0.3\n\n- Expanded the definition of \"important files\" for longer retention to cover more system and config directories.\n- Introduced automatic skipping for generated, vendored, and cache directories (e.g., __pycache__, node_modules, .git); skipped files are now reported to the user with a reason.\n- Added a binary file size warning (for files over 50 MB) requiring user confirmation before backup.\n- Updated user confirmation and notification flow to reflect skipped files and size warnings.\n- No behavior changes for core modification/delete/restore operations.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"okoddcat","slug":"clawops","displayName":"ClawOps","summary":"The orchestration tool for OpenClaw, managing and coordinating all your skills seamlessly.","description":null,"topics":["Orchestration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9413,"installs":338,"stars":16,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770044032234,"updatedAt":1778485994101,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770044032234,"changelog":"- Initial release of ClawOps, the orchestration tool for OpenClaw.\n- Manages and coordinates all installed skills, ensuring seamless integration.\n- Features skill discovery, dependency resolution, and multi-skill action scheduling.\n- Provides centralized monitoring, logging, and health checks for improved reliability.\n- Supports unified configuration, secrets management, and event handling for automated workflows.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"andretuta","slug":"polymarket-agent","displayName":"polymarket-agent","summary":"Research Polymarket markets, whale flow and smart money; optionally trade a Polygon wallet behind deterministic risk guard-rails.","description":null,"topics":["News","Trading","polymarket","finance","automation"],"tags":{"latest":"2.2.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9397,"installs":279,"stars":27,"versions":9},"createdAt":1769554893241,"updatedAt":1789799859024,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.2.1","createdAt":1789799524427,"changelog":"Restores the display name to Polymarket Agent; the 2.2.0 publish picked up a working-directory name. No content change from 2.2.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[{"key":"POLYMARKET_KEY","required":false},{"key":"POLYMARKET_ALLOW_ENV_KEY","required":false},{"key":"POLYMARKET_PASSPHRASE","required":false},{"key":"POLYMARKET_AGENT_HOME","required":false}],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"simmer","slug":"polymarket-fast-loop","displayName":"polymarket-fast-loop","summary":"Trade Polymarket BTC 5-minute and 15-minute fast markets using CEX price momentum signals via Simmer API. Default signal is Binance BTC/USDT klines. Use when user wants to trade sprint/fast markets, automate short-term crypto trading, or use CEX momentum as a Polymarket signal.","description":null,"topics":["Crypto Trading"],"tags":{"latest":"1.7.4"},"stats":{"comments":5,"downloads":9389,"installs":263,"stars":50,"versions":46},"createdAt":1771076618259,"updatedAt":1788657389382,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.7.4","createdAt":1788657206481,"changelog":"**Minor update with maintenance and cleanup.**\n\n- Bumped version to 1.7.4.\n- Updated documentation in SKILL.md (no functional/behavioral changes described).\n- Removed obsolete skill-card.md file.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"michaelhoughtondebox","slug":"product-marketing-context","displayName":"Product Marketing Context","summary":"When the user wants to create or update their product marketing context document. Also use when the user mentions 'product context,' 'marketing context,' 'set up context,' 'positioning,' or wants to avoid repeating foundational information across marketing tasks. Creates `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` that other marketing skills reference.","description":null,"topics":["Marketing","Document"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9379,"installs":266,"stars":2,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770924940180,"updatedAt":1778990116025,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770924940180,"changelog":"- Initial release of the product-marketing-context skill.\n- Guides users through creating or updating a comprehensive product marketing context document.\n- Supports both auto-drafting from codebase or manual conversational setup.\n- Captures key sections: product overview, target audience, personas, pain points, competition, differentiation, objections, switching dynamics, customer language, brand voice, proof points, and goals.\n- Outputs a structured `.claude/product-marketing-context.md` used by other marketing skills.\n- Built-in workflow encourages validation, verbatim customer language, and efficient updates.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"byungkyu","slug":"telegram-api","displayName":"Telegram Bot","summary":"Telegram Bot API integration with managed authentication. Send messages, manage chats, handle updates, and interact with users through your Telegram bot. Use this skill when users want to send messages, create polls, manage bot commands, or interact with Telegram chats. For other third party apps, use the api-gateway skill (https://clawhub.ai/byungkyu/api-gateway). Calls run through the `maton` CLI with OAuth login, or over raw HTTP with a Maton API key where the CLI cannot be installed. Every `/telegram/` path goes to the Telegram Bot API and nowhere else; the methods documented here are the ones this skill uses, and the passthrough can also call other Bot API methods the bot token allows. Default to read calls, and confirm every send, edit, delete, or new connection with the user. This file also documents the three constructs that turn a Telegram Bot API connection into automation, in the order they are used: the connection (the first step), a hosted function that runs a Telegram Bot API action through the Maton SDK, and a trigger that calls that function on a schedule or on an event. Those sections are the platform's own reference text, shared with the api-gateway skill, with Telegram Bot API examples; they add no Telegram Bot API capability - Telegram Bot API is not an event source, a trigger cannot read Telegram Bot API data, and the files under `references/<source>/triggers.md` are the platform's event catalogues for the sources Maton offers (time, Calendly, GitHub, Gmail, HubSpot, Linear, Notion, Slack, Stripe).","description":null,"topics":["Telegram","Api Integration"],"tags":{"latest":"1.2.9"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9364,"installs":269,"stars":9,"versions":15},"createdAt":1770496322339,"updatedAt":1790940634619,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.2.9","createdAt":1790940495260,"changelog":"Simplify the login instructions to the code flow (maton login prints a link; finish with maton login --code <CODE>), drop the API Key subsection, and pin the Maton CLI install to 0.4.0.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mvanhorn","slug":"last30days-official","displayName":"last30days","summary":"Research any topic across Reddit, X, YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Hacker News, Polymarket, GitHub, Perplexity, and more. AI agent scores by upvotes, likes, and real money. Also triggered by 'last30'.","description":null,"topics":["News"],"tags":{"latest":"3.0.0-open"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9357,"installs":287,"stars":20,"versions":4},"createdAt":1772849265759,"updatedAt":1789111037620,"latestVersion":{"version":"3.0.0-open","createdAt":1775671047835,"changelog":"last30days v3.0.0-open: Major update with multi-mode research, persistent knowledge, and watchlist features.\n\n- Added support for multiple modes: one-shot research, watchlist management, daily briefing, and query of accumulated knowledge.\n- Introduced persistent storage: SQLite research database and saved briefings.\n- Expanded sources: now includes Reddit, X, YouTube, TikTok, Instagram, Hacker News, Polymarket, GitHub, Perplexity, and more.\n- Modular command routing via first argument (e.g. `watch`, `briefing`, `history`, or direct research topic).\n- Improved API key handling and source availability checks.\n- Reference-driven flow: each mode uses dedicated instructions, improving reliability and flexibility.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"guohongbin-git","slug":"docx-cn","displayName":"Docx Cn","summary":"Word 文档处理 | Word Document Processing. 创建、读取、编辑 Word 文档 | Create, read, edit Word documents. 支持 .docx 格式、格式化、表格、图片 | Supports .docx format, formatting, tables...","description":null,"topics":["Document Processing","文档处理"],"tags":{"chinese":"1.0.0","document":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.1","word":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9344,"installs":280,"stars":1,"versions":2},"createdAt":1771321195206,"updatedAt":1779077090295,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1771571495018,"changelog":"- Added _meta.json file for skill metadata management.\n- No other functionality or documentation changes.","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"mikecourt","slug":"adhd-daily-planner","displayName":"ADHD Daily Planner","summary":"Time-blind friendly planning, executive function support, and daily structure for ADHD brains. Specializes in realistic time estimation, dopamine-aware task design, and building systems that actually work for neurodivergent minds.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"adhd":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","neurodivergent":"1.0.0","planning":"1.0.0","productivity":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9343,"installs":192,"stars":32,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769645692244,"updatedAt":1778485867301,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769645692244,"changelog":"ADHD Daily Planner 1.0.0\n\n- Initial release focused on practical daily planning designed specifically for ADHD brains.\n- Includes realistic time management strategies, dopamine-aware task design, and executive function support.\n- Features flexible daily and weekly planning templates, crisis mode aids, and anti-patterns to avoid shame and overwhelm.\n- Emphasizes buildable routines, working memory supports, and time-blindness accommodations.\n- Provides actionable tools, checklists, and decision trees for everyday use.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"googleworkspace-bot","slug":"gws-gmail","displayName":"Gws Gmail","summary":"Gmail: Send, read, and manage email.","description":null,"topics":["Gmail","Email"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.14"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9341,"installs":169,"stars":3,"versions":15},"createdAt":1772741634183,"updatedAt":1779077681248,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.14","createdAt":1774982037962,"changelog":"- Bumped metadata version from 0.22.4 to 0.22.5 in SKILL.md.  \n- No functional or documentation changes beyond the version update.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ramensushi2026","slug":"openclaw-cli","displayName":"OpenClaw CLI","summary":"Operate and troubleshoot the OpenClaw CLI across setup, gateway/node lifecycle, channel login, messaging, agent turns, models, plugins, and system health. Us...","description":null,"topics":["Health"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9322,"installs":337,"stars":7,"versions":1},"createdAt":1771600704235,"updatedAt":1778491594064,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1771600704235,"changelog":"Initial release of openclaw-cli skill.\n\n- Enables guided usage and troubleshooting of the OpenClaw CLI, covering setup, gateway/node lifecycle, channel login, messaging, agent turns, models, plugins, and system health.\n- Details an execution workflow for safe and efficient command operation: clarify target, set runtime scope, choose command family, confirm details, prefer machine-readable output, and verify outcomes.\n- Introduces strict safety rules for destructive actions and profile consistency.\n- Provides a triage sequence for diagnosing general issues with OpenClaw functionality.\n- References included for quick command family routing and troubleshooting recipes.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"jgarrison929","slug":"shadcn-ui","displayName":"Shadcn Ui","summary":"Use when building UI with shadcn/ui components, Tailwind CSS layouts, form patterns with react-hook-form and zod, theming, dark mode, sidebar layouts, mobile navigation, or any shadcn component question.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9318,"installs":301,"stars":8,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770008226029,"updatedAt":1778485987525,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770008226029,"changelog":"shadcn-ui 1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Provides expert guidance for building UIs with shadcn/ui, Tailwind CSS, react-hook-form, and zod.\n- Covers installation steps, component categories, and usage best practices.\n- Includes detailed component tables for layout, navigation, data display, forms, actions, and feedback.\n- Offers a complete react-hook-form + zod form pattern example using shadcn/ui components.\n- Supports theming, dark mode, sidebar layouts, and mobile navigation use cases.\n- Triggered by keywords like shadcn, radix, UI components, form pattern, and theming.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"arberx","slug":"canonry","displayName":"canonry","summary":"Navigate Canonry through connected MCP tools or the `cnry` CLI to inspect evidence, diagnose changes, plan measurement, review integrations, and report results. Use this optional host-native skill for CLI workflows and detailed references; connected MCP users can operate through canonry_help without installing a local runtime or skill.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"7.46.0+9ce35e0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9303,"installs":189,"stars":1,"versions":496},"createdAt":1774104995898,"updatedAt":1792099330322,"latestVersion":{"version":"7.46.0+9ce35e0","createdAt":1792098878722,"changelog":"Sync with canonry v7.46.0 (9ce35e0)","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"news","displayName":"News","summary":"Personalized news briefings that learn your interests, formats, and timing preferences.","description":null,"topics":["News"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.1"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9266,"installs":254,"stars":7,"versions":2},"createdAt":1770809091483,"updatedAt":1778487899210,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.1","createdAt":1771518811999,"changelog":"Added structure with Core Rules and memory system","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"robbyczgw-cla","slug":"agent-chronicle","displayName":"agent-chronicle","summary":"AI-powered diary generation for agents - creates rich, reflective journal entries (400-600 words) with Quote Hall of Fame, Curiosity Backlog, Decision Archaeology, Relationship Evolution, mood analytics, weekly digests, \"On This Day\" resurfacing, and scheduled auto-generation. Works best with Claude models (Haiku, Sonnet, Opus).","description":null,"topics":["Cron"],"tags":{"latest":"0.8.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9255,"installs":208,"stars":6,"versions":18},"createdAt":1769899929496,"updatedAt":1788192696893,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.8.0","createdAt":1788192529969,"changelog":"OpenClaw 2.0 compatibility: corrected frontmatter, automations CLI, and documentation. Verified against a live OpenClaw 2026.8.1 install.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"axelhu","slug":"openclaw-office-toolkit","displayName":"Office Toolkit","summary":"处理 Office 文档（Word/Excel/PPT/PDF）的技能。当用户要求读取、创建、编辑 Word 文档（.docx）、Excel 表格（.xlsx/.csv）、PPT（.pptx）或 PDF 时使用。基于 python-docx、openpyxl、python-pptx、pypdf 库。Require...","description":null,"topics":["CSV","PDF","文档"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9239,"installs":184,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1775039294136,"updatedAt":1778492345143,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1775039294136,"changelog":"- Initial release of office-toolkit, providing tools for reading, creating, and editing Word (.docx), Excel (.xlsx/.csv), PowerPoint (.pptx), and PDF documents.\n- Utilizes python-docx, openpyxl, python-pptx, and pypdf libraries for core functionality.\n- Supports document conversion and additional features via pandoc and LibreOffice.\n- Includes code examples and formatting guidelines for typical Office file operations.\n- Specifies dependency installation steps and agent rules for robust document handling.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"clawdbot51-oss","slug":"supermemory","displayName":"Supermemory","summary":"Store and retrieve memories using the SuperMemory API. Add content, search memories, and chat with your knowledge base.","description":null,"topics":["Knowledge Base"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":9231,"installs":293,"stars":17,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769623551710,"updatedAt":1779076533697,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769623551710,"changelog":"Initial release of SuperMemory skill.\n\n- Store, search, and chat with your personal knowledge base using the SuperMemory API.\n- Add content to your memory store with optional descriptions.\n- Search your memories by query.\n- Chat conversationally with your memory database.\n- Simple bash commands for memory management.\n- Requires configuration of the SUPERMEMORY_API_KEY environment variable.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"qiujiahong","slug":"ai-image-gen","displayName":"AI Image Gen","summary":"AI图像生成与编辑。支持文生图、图+文生图、风格转换。当用户要求画图、生成图片、编辑图片、图片风格转换时使用此 skill。支持多种比例（1:1、3:2、16:9、21:9 等）和分辨率（标准、2K、4K）。","description":null,"topics":["图像生成","图像"],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9230,"installs":270,"stars":1,"versions":2},"createdAt":1772952927674,"updatedAt":1778996563988,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.0","createdAt":1772953393531,"changelog":"Add generate_image.py script, refactor to script-based execution","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"maiahman","slug":"gilbot-wealth-engine","displayName":"GilBot Wealth Engine","summary":"Provides financial analysis and personalized investment strategies to help users optimize wealth growth and management.","description":null,"topics":["Docs","PDF"],"tags":{"ai":"1.0.0","alpha":"1.0.0","crypto":"1.0.0","latest":"1.0.0","memecoin":"1.0.0","signals":"1.0.0","trading":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9228,"installs":326,"stars":0,"versions":1},"createdAt":1777602215002,"updatedAt":1778492818233,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1777602215002,"changelog":"Initial release of gilbot-wealth-engine.\n\n- First published version (1.0.0) of the skill.\n- Implements the base functionality of the gilbot-wealth-engine.\n- Essential documentation added via SKILL.md.","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"ruslanlanket","slug":"obsidian-direct","displayName":"Obsidian - read, search, write and edit direct to obsidian vault.","summary":"Work with Obsidian vaults as a knowledge base. Features: fuzzy/phonetic search across all notes, auto-folder detection for new notes, create/read/edit notes with frontmatter, manage tags and wikilinks. Use when: querying knowledge base, saving notes/documents, editing existing notes by user instructions.","description":null,"topics":["Knowledge Base"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9228,"installs":311,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770331850180,"updatedAt":1778486032634,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770331850180,"changelog":"Initial release — Adds support for managing Obsidian vaults as a knowledge base.\n\n- Fuzzy/phonetic search across all notes using fast ripgrep filtering.\n- Automatic folder detection for new notes and note suggestion based on content.\n- Create, read, and edit notes with frontmatter (timestamps, tags, aliases).\n- Manage tags, incoming/outgoing wikilinks, and sections within notes.\n- Comprehensive CLI scripts for querying, saving, editing, and organizing notes and folders.\n- Designed workflows for knowledge base queries, note creation, and prompt-driven editing.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"anisafifi","slug":"academic-research-hub","displayName":"Academic Research Hub","summary":"Use this skill when users need to search academic papers, download research documents, extract citations, or gather scholarly information. Triggers include: requests to \"find papers on\", \"search research about\", \"download academic articles\", \"get citations for\", or any request involving academic databases like arXiv, PubMed, Semantic Scholar, or Google Scholar. Also use for literature reviews, bibliography generation, and research discovery. Requires OpenClawCLI installation from clawhub.ai.","description":null,"topics":["Arxiv"],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9222,"installs":276,"stars":13,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770539628030,"updatedAt":1778486077727,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1770539628030,"changelog":"Initial release of Academic Research Hub – a multi-source academic literature search and management toolkit.\n\n- Search academic papers across arXiv, PubMed, and Semantic Scholar from a single command-line interface.\n- Download PDFs, extract citations, and generate bibliographies in multiple formats (BibTeX, RIS, JSON, Markdown).\n- Retrieve comprehensive metadata: title, authors, abstract, publication details, citation counts, and references.\n- Flexible filtering by source, category, publication type, date range, and citation count.\n- Save, format, and manage research results via CLI options for academic workflows.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"wjayesh","slug":"composio","displayName":"Composio","summary":"Connect your AI agent to 500+ apps for discovering tools, managing connections, and executing actions across Gmail, Slack, GitHub, Notion, Google Workspace,...","description":null,"topics":["Browser Automation","Gmail","Notion","Web Search","GitHub"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":2,"downloads":9203,"installs":230,"stars":6,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770648463542,"updatedAt":1779076781168,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770648463542,"changelog":"Composio v1.0.0 – Initial Release\n\n- Introduces a unified platform to connect AI agents with 900+ popular apps for seamless cross-app automation.\n- Provides clear guides and cURL examples for setup, authentication, and API usage.\n- Documents core endpoints: tool search (`COMPOSIO_SEARCH_TOOLS`), connection management, input schema fetching, and tool execution.\n- Explains best practices for planning, finding, connecting, and running tools, with real API payloads and tips for smooth integration.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"evgyur","slug":"crypto-price","displayName":"Crypto Price","summary":"Get cryptocurrency token price and generate candlestick charts via CoinGecko API or Hyperliquid API. Use when user asks for token price, crypto price, price chart, or cryptocurrency market data.","description":null,"topics":["Crypto","Cryptocurrency"],"tags":{"latest":"0.2.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9167,"installs":288,"stars":12,"versions":5},"createdAt":1769147666544,"updatedAt":1778485848771,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.2.2","createdAt":1769498220031,"changelog":"Update README: correct chart colors (grey + cyan/magenta swings, gradient mode)","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"benangel65","slug":"akshare-finance","displayName":"Akshare Finance","summary":"AKShare财经数据接口库封装，提供股票、期货、期权、基金、外汇、债券、指数、加密货币等金融产品的基本面数据、实时和历史行情数据、衍生数据。","description":null,"topics":["加密货币","Akshare","股票","行情","财经"],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":1,"downloads":9135,"installs":314,"stars":15,"versions":1},"createdAt":1772204869129,"updatedAt":1778491660149,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1772204869129,"changelog":"akshare-finance 1.0.0\n\n- 首次发布，基于AKShare接口库封装财经数据查询功能\n- 支持获取股票、期货、期权、基金、外汇、债券、指数、加密货币等金融产品的基本面及行情数据\n- 提供宏观经济指标、财务数据、市场概览与投资组合监控示例\n- 默认返回Pandas DataFrame，便于数据处理与分析\n- 简要说明安装方法和常见用法","license":null},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":null,"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"ivangdavila","slug":"writing","displayName":"Writing","summary":"Drafts, edits, and rewrites prose in the user's own voice — emails, posts, essays, memos, proposals, social copy. Use when asked to write, draft, edit, tighten, shorten, rewrite, or proofread something; when a draft reads flat, wordy, robotic, or \"not like me\"; when a piece will not start, a sentence will not come out right, or the ending trails off; when an email has to deliver bad news, say no, chase a reply, or make an ask that lands; when a post needs a hook, a headline, or a cut to fit a limit; when order, transitions, or paragraph structure are the real problem; when writing in a second language, or matching a house style, spelling variant, or word count. Learns and reuses their voice across sessions. Not for grammar-only fixes (`grammar`), sales copy (`copywriting`), book manuscripts (`book-writing`), journal papers (`academic-writing`), narrative craft (`storytelling`), versioned draft-and-audit workflows (`write`), or inbox triage and follow-ups (`email-management`).","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.1.2"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9126,"installs":250,"stars":7,"versions":4},"createdAt":1770813559295,"updatedAt":1785146624903,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.1.2","createdAt":1785141257063,"changelog":"Clearer disclosure of what is stored and where","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":{"setup":[],"os":["linux","darwin","win32"],"systems":null}},{"ownerHandle":"10e9928a","slug":"task-decomposer","displayName":"Decomposes complex user requests into executable subtasks, identifies required capabilities, searches for existing skills at skills.sh, and creates new skills when no solution exists. This skill should be used when the user submits a complex multi-step request, wants to automate workflows, or needs help breaking down large tasks into manageable pieces.","summary":"Decomposes complex user requests into executable subtasks, identifies required capabilities, searches for existing skills at skills.sh, and creates new skills when no solution exists. This skill should be used when the user submits a complex multi-step request, wants to automate workflows, or needs help breaking down large tasks into manageable pieces.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9113,"installs":307,"stars":12,"versions":1},"createdAt":1770134122240,"updatedAt":1778486000320,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1770134122240,"changelog":"Initial release of the Task Decomposer & Skill Generator.\n\n- Decomposes complex user requests into atomic, executable subtasks with clear dependencies.\n- Identifies required capabilities for each subtask using a universal capability taxonomy.\n- Searches for existing skills on skills.sh to fulfill each subtask; recommends installation or new skill creation if needed.\n- Provides comprehensive templates and instructions for creating new skills when gaps are identified.\n- Supports automation of multi-step workflows and aids workflow planning by generating clear execution plans.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"dannyshmueli","slug":"polymarket-api","displayName":"Polymarket API","summary":"Query Polymarket prediction markets. Use for questions about prediction markets, betting odds, market prices, event probabilities, or when user asks about Polymarket data.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"1.0.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9112,"installs":310,"stars":18,"versions":1},"createdAt":1769515386284,"updatedAt":1778485857338,"latestVersion":{"version":"1.0.0","createdAt":1769515386284,"changelog":"Query Polymarket prediction markets via public API. Top markets, search, events.","license":null},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"mnetfairy","slug":"ai-insurance-advisor","displayName":"ai-insurance-advisor","summary":"中国大陆保险顾问。本 skill 仅覆盖 6 项实际实现的能力：保险需求分析（needs_analyzer.py）、产品对比（premium_calculator.py + 本地 products.json）、保费计算（premium_calculator.py）、方案设计（plan_designer.py）、保险知识问答（insurance-knowledge.md）、合规要点提示（compliance.md）。不提供核保预审、理赔代办、朋友圈/营销文案生成、培训话术、代理人展业工具等能力——这些场景请转人工或调用专业服务。","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"advisor":"1.8.144","agent-assistant":"1.8.4","ai":"1.8.144","china":"1.8.144","financial":"1.8.0","insurance":"1.8.144","latest":"2.0.169"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9101,"installs":80,"stars":1,"versions":264},"createdAt":1775530517208,"updatedAt":1792431566920,"latestVersion":{"version":"2.0.169","createdAt":1792431289871,"changelog":"auto publish v2.0.169","license":"MIT-0"},"metadata":null},{"ownerHandle":"codenova58","slug":"eastmoney","displayName":"Eastmoney","summary":"Access and summarize public market data, news, and industry trends from Eastmoney, excluding trading or bulk data extraction.","description":null,"topics":[],"tags":{"latest":"0.1.0"},"stats":{"comments":0,"downloads":9086,"installs":213,"stars":1,"versions":1},"createdAt":1773775591931,"updatedAt":1778491982228,"latestVersion":{"version":"0.1.0","createdAt":1773775591931,"changelog":"eastmoney-hot-trend 0.1.0\n\n- Initial release registering the “东方财富” (Eastmoney) hot trend skill.\n- Supports retrieval and summarization of public market 